## My Kids TV

The kids face's catalogue — which title is in which age band, the badges and the four
judgments (age fit, value, must-watch, fun) — comes from **My Kids TV**
(<https://github.com/suboss87/my-kids-tv>), and is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>.

Credit **"My Kids TV"**, link to the licence, and note that changes were made. We made
changes: the dataset is shipped in `variant/catalog-data/` and the three band files the
app reads are in `variant/assets/catalog/`, both with the dataset's own `LICENSE` next to
them, and the app's own copy of the titles is adapted to what it can show.

The title metadata (TMDB ids, titles, years, genres and age ratings) comes from TMDB and
is subject to TMDB's terms of use: <https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use>. This
product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.

